#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:1
#: 8d98dc256f804623b902fb8ff888231d
msgid "环境安装与配置"
msgstr "Environment Installation and Configuration"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:3
#: 17fa0bd561834823b113d68fb0e270c0
msgid ""
"UniKT 采用 [Pixi](https://pixi.sh/) "
"进行依赖和多环境生命周期管理。通过严格的版本锁定（`pixi.lock`），Pixi 确保了跨不同实验机器与计算节点环境的一致性，有效避免了 "
"PyTorch、CUDA 与 PyTorch Geometric（PyG）等底层 C++/CUDA 扩展库的版本漂移。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT uses [Pixi](https://pixi.sh/) for dependency and multi-environment "
"lifecycle management. Through strict version locking (`pixi.lock`), Pixi "
"guarantees consistency across different experiment machines and computing"
" nodes, effectively preventing version drift in underlying C++/CUDA "
"extension libraries such as PyTorch, CUDA, and PyTorch Geometric (PyG)."

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:7
#: f290b8df2a3246a495d7d4ebf024ba0f
msgid "前置要求"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:9
#: d1abf7b707b84c5e9dd463d3b7882227
msgid "**操作系统**：Linux x86_64（推荐 Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 等主流发行版，需要 glibc >= 2.38）。"
msgstr ""
"**Operating System**: Linux x86_64 (Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 and other "
"mainstream distributions recommended, glibc >= 2.38 required)."

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:10
#: 2509164f79984590b89c8cc5c4e1c992
msgid "**硬件支持**："
msgstr "**Hardware Support**:"

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:11
#: e549860d1cc94bed86fd23f7f628fea7
msgid "GPU 环境：推荐 NVIDIA GPU（计算能力 >= 7.0），驱动版本需支持 CUDA 12.8（驱动版本 >= 525.60.13）。"
msgstr ""
"GPU environment: NVIDIA GPU recommended (Compute Capability >= 7.0), "
"driver must support CUDA 12.8 (driver version >= 525.60.13)."

#: ../../source/getting-started/installation.md:12
#: 5ee0a4a61a474a59bcdcdcfb44145ad2
msgid "CPU 环境：支持任意 x86_64 架构机器，适合轻量调试与无 GPU 服务器。"
msgstr ""
